@guide H_Stonetalon
@name Stonetalon Mountains (Sun Rock Retreat)
@faction Horde
@levels 21-25
@zone Stonetalon Mountains
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Sun Rock Retreat, Malaka'jin, the Venture Co. at Windshear Crag and the harpies. A short stop before Ashenvale.
@next H_Ashenvale

turnin Letter to Jin'Zil [optional] | Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, if you took the letter in the Barrens.
accept Jin'Zil's Forest Magic | Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, Malaka'jin (south).
accept Harpies Threaten | Maggran Earthbinder, Sun Rock Retreat.
accept Trouble in the Deeps | Tsunaman. Turned in at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale (next guide).
accept Cenarius' Legacy | Braelyn Firehand.
fp Sun Rock Retreat
bind Sun Rock Retreat
accept 1090 Gerenzo's Orders | Piznik at the Windshear mine.
complete Harpies Threaten | Bloodfury harpies on the ridge east of Sun Rock.
complete Jin'Zil's Forest Magic | Venture Co. operators and Stonetalon creatures.
complete 1090 Gerenzo's Orders | Venture Co. at Windshear Crag.
complete Cenarius' Legacy
turnin Harpies Threaten
accept Bloodfury Bloodline
accept Elemental War
turnin Jin'Zil's Forest Magic
turnin 1090 Gerenzo's Orders
turnin Cenarius' Legacy
accept Ordanus
complete Bloodfury Bloodline
complete Elemental War
complete Ordanus | Ordanus is in the Sons of Cenarius camp.
turnin Bloodfury Bloodline
turnin Elemental War
turnin Ordanus
level 24
train | Orgrimmar or Thunder Bluff.
note Take the Talondeep Path north-east into Ashenvale; Splintertree Post is the Horde town.
